From 2b5b0760d57de9cffba696bd4385803bde5f08e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 07:57:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mirror JGDMS dynamic grant semantics: CodebaseDomainGrant,
 signer checks

Mirrors JGDMS commit c3dcea47 (SOW-PermissionGrant-Mirror-and-ProtectionDomain-Grants):
- CertificateGrant.impliesSigners, used by URIGrant and DigestGrant.
- CodeSourceKey (Uri + signers + digest) for ProtectionDomainGrant.impliesCodeSource.
- New CodebaseDomainGrant and PermissionGrantBuilder.CODEBASE_DOMAIN = 7.
- Deprecate CLASSLOADER / ClassLoaderGrant.
- PrincipalGrant: escape control characters as JGDMS does.
- jtreg tests GrantSignerTest and CodebaseDomainGrantTest; JGDMS_COMPATIBILITY.md.

Not built or run here: only compile-checked against stubs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
